{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28049","headline":"送阆州妓人归老 · 何扶","name":"送阆州妓人归老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹翠婵娟草迳幽，佳人归老傍汀洲。\n玉蟾露冷梁尘暗，金凤花开云鬓秋。\n十亩稻香新绿野，一声歌断旧青楼。\n芭蕉半卷西池雨，日暮门前双白鸥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何扶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}